  "summary": "The candidate has real frontend implementation mass and covers most of the REQ-004 UI flow, but it is not hardening-ready. The main acceptance gap is the missing browser smoke required by the REQ; current tests are only JSDOM component tests with stubbed clients. Promotion fit is also weakened because the slice carries its own API/auth seams instead of aligning to the shared frontend modules required by the plan.",
  "scope_fidelity": {
