      "401 and 403 handling is implemented at component/hook level, but only through mocked navigation and mocked client errors rather than a browser-level route flow."
    ]
  },
  "source_substance": {
    "status": "adequate",
    "notes": [
      "This is not skeletal for a frontend upload slice: validation logic, runtime-configured HTTP client, mutation hook, page component, and UI component are all present.",
      "The implementation has meaningful behavior rather than placeholder-only seams.",
      "However, the source is more self-contained than plan-aligned: slice-local API and auth redirect handling are embedded under frontend.app.intake.upload instead of flowing through the planned shared.api and shared.auth modules.",
      "Promotion hardening will require integration reshaping, not just polish."
    ]
  },
  "test_substance": {
    "status": "partial",
    "notes": [
      "Tests cover real user interactions in JSDOM for rendering, invalid type, oversize file, drag-and-drop happy path, and auth redirects.",
