      "No browser smoke or e2e test is present despite that being an explicit REQ acceptance and a KIT-readiness expectation in the plan.",
      "The suite proves component behavior credibly, but it does not prove promotable end-to-end acceptance."
    ]
  },
  "docs_code_coherence": {
    "status": "mixed",
    "notes": [
      "README, KIT, HOWTO, and LTC are largely consistent with the emitted files and commands.",
