  "hardening_targets": [
    "Add real browser automation covering one valid upload path and one invalid upload path for REQ-004 acceptance.",
    "Add contract-level test coverage for the actual upload adapter, including multipart POST /documents behavior and invalid backend response handling.",
    "Refactor or rebind upload API/auth wiring to the planned shared frontend seams so the slice matches promotion architecture.",
